 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Try going somewhere quiet, like coffee shop, with few distractions. If at home, close background apps and use timer for short bursts. A long cable helps stop it from being on the desk, or you can use phone battery mode if you expecting a long afternoon. Try earplugs if they' really loud, or listen through headphones of the music you' working to. It beats getting their rhythm and stopping doing music of your own. It' worth a trial day or two. Libraries are great for quiet and sometimes internet access.",
